# ── Gemini backend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Option A — Google AI Studio (free tier, geo-restricted)
#   Works only in countries supported by Google AI Studio.
#   Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here

# Option B — Vertex AI (globally available, bypasses geo-restrictions)
#   Requires a Google Cloud project with the Vertex AI API enabled.
#   Billing must be active on the GCP project (Gemini 2.5 Flash is low cost).
#
#   Step 1 — Create a GCP project and enable Vertex AI:
#     https://console.cloud.google.com/
#     Enable API: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/aiplatform.googleapis.com
#
#   Step 2 — Auth (choose one):
#
#     Local development:
#       Run once: gcloud auth application-default login
#       Then set only GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT below — no JSON needed.
#
#     Render / cloud deploy:
#       Create a service account with the "Vertex AI User" role.
#       Download the JSON key file.
#       Paste the ENTIRE contents of the JSON file as the value of
#       GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS_JSON below (all on one line).
#
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=us-central1
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS_JSON={"type":"service_account","project_id":"..."}
